religious denomination in Malaita (Fig.26). The next largest group was the Church of Melanesia 
with a share of 26% of all denominations, followed by the Roman Catholic Church (24%), and the 
Seventh Day Adventists (6%). All other denominations had less than 12% affiliation. 
 
